# Peka — Co-op 2D Platform Puzzler

> Game Design Document (living draft). Filled out as we ideate.

---

## 1. Description

A **2D co-op platform game** built around **cooperative puzzles**. Two players
progress through **one long level** together. The level is designed so it is
**impossible to complete solo** — every major obstacle requires both players to
act in coordination. The fun comes from communication, timing, and each player
controlling something the other depends on.

**Core pillars**
- **Forced cooperation** — no section clears without two players.
- **Puzzle-first platforming** — jumping/movement is the verb; the brain-teaser is the challenge.
- **One handcrafted level** — a single, long, escalating journey rather than many short stages.

**Player fantasy** _(TBD)_ — what does it feel like to play? Comedic? Tense? Cozy?

